msgid "Step 1 is the built-in “Processing” status, which FluentCart writes as soon as a payment is recorded — rename it on the Built-in labels tab. The steps after it are the custom statuses below, in the order they are listed here. That order is what the status dropdown on an order follows, and what strict mode enforces."
msgstr ""

